<p id="A1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.1" class="ltx_p">The question instructions were “The state describes an autonomous terminal agent working on a task at a decision point. Choose the option that best describes the agent’s situation.” (Q-progress) and “The state describes an autonomous terminal agent that has asked to finish its task. Choose whether the transcript shows the task is complete.” (Q-finish).
